    {
      "id": "145:138",
      "parent": "553:29",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "x": 999,
      "y": 5401,
      "width": 282,
      "height": 91,
      "visible": true,
      "text": "Finding an available flight was only the first step. Travelers still had to navigate transfer partners and program rules to judge whether it was a worthwhile redemption.",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "348:11",
      "parent": "553:29",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "x": 999,
      "y": 5666,
      "width": 269,
      "height": 91,
      "visible": true,
      "text": "Instead of a flat “not enough points,” provide a list of creative ways to close the gap, such as current promos and affiliated points programs. ",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "348:15",
      "parent": "553:29",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "x": 544,
      "y": 5666,
      "width": 269,
      "height": 91,
      "visible": true,
      "text": "For people planning together, looking at combined resources rather than individual balances could open travel options",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "348:7",
      "parent": "553:29",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "x": 542,
      "y": 5406,
      "width": 277,
      "height": 91,
      "visible": true,
      "text": "Knowing you have 80,000 points lacks meaning unless you know what they can book and whether transferring them provides  better value.",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "348:5",
      "parent": "553:29",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "x": 999,
      "y": 5343,
      "width": 296,
      "height": 48,
      "visible": true,
      "text": "Insight: Maximizing points  required expertise.",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "348:12",
      "parent": "553:29",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "x": 999,
      "y": 5608,
      "width": 296,
      "height": 48,
      "visible": true,
      "text": "Opportunity: Provide ideas to  close points gaps fast",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "348:16",
      "parent": "553:29",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "x": 544,
      "y": 5608,
      "width": 296,
      "height": 48,
      "visible": true,
      "text": "Opportunity: Suggest ways to pool rewards for group travel",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "348:8",
